echnology, making it extremely functional for all aspects of communication and publishing. It is a robust legible typeface yet compact enough to enable tight inter-line spacing which is good for space economy.http://www.microsoft.com/typography/ctfontshttp://www.c-and-g.co.jpMicrosoft supplied font. You may use this font to create, display, and print content as permitted by the license terms or terms of use, of the Microsoft product, service, or content in which this font was included. You may only (i) embed this font in content as permitted by the embedding restrictions included in this font; and (ii) temporarily download this font to a printer or other output device to help print content. Any other use is prohibited.http://www.microsoft.com/typography/fonts/default.aspx␀N␀e␀g␀r␀e␀t␀a␀M␀e␀i␀r␀y␀o␀ ␀N␀e␀g␀r␀e␀t␀a␀t␀u␀n␀й␀M␀e␀i␀r␀y␀o␀ ␀t␀u␀n␀й␀f␀e␀d␀M␀e␀i␀r␀y␀o␀ ␀f␀e␀d␀F␀e␀t␀t␀M␀e␀i␀r␀y␀o␀ ␀F␀e␀t␀t€ЅДїЅ±␀M␀e␀i␀r␀y␀o␀ €ЅДїЅ±␀N␀e␀g␀r␀i␀t␀a␀M␀e␀i␀r␀y␀o␀ ␀N␀e␀g␀r␀i␀t␀a␀L␀i␀h␀a␀v␀o␀i␀t␀u␀M␀e␀i␀r␀y␀o␀ ␀L␀i␀h␀a␀v␀o␀i␀t␀u␀G␀r␀a␀s␀M␀e␀i␀r␀y␀o␀ ␀G␀r␀a␀s␀F␀й␀l␀k␀ц␀v␀й␀r␀M␀e␀i␀r␀y␀o␀ ␀F␀й␀l␀k␀ц␀v␀й␀r␀G␀r␀a␀s␀s␀e␀t␀t␀o␀M␀e␀i␀r␀y␀o␀ ␀G␀r␀a␀s␀s␀e␀t␀t␀o0б0¤0к0Є0Ь0ь0л0Й␀M␀i␀c␀r␀o␀s␀o␀f␀t␀:␀ 0б0¤0к0Є␀ 0Ь0ь0л0Й0б0¤0к0Є0o0|sVэ␀ ␀M␀i␀c␀r␀o␀s␀o␀f␀t␀ ␀C␀o␀r␀p␀o␀r␀a␀t␀i␀o␀n␀ 0n|sVэ0J0€0s0]0nNЦ0nVэ0k0J0Q0‹v{“2UFj0~0_0oUFj0g0Y00б0¤0к0Є0ы0Х0©0у0И0o0№0Ї0к0ь0у0g0‚0Ч0к0у0И0g0‚iu0Ѓ0f0Ї0к0ў0ь0gЉ­0f0O0^ѓ0Du(ђ0kђi0W0_e°NNг0n0µ0у0»0к0ХfшOS0g0Y0ry0kmІfv0№0Ї0к0ь0уN
